set up everything you mention but it didn`t work, I am using `streamlit==1.38.0` and application itself in the docker container, on the :80 port its working fine but when we switch to :443 this agains starts to hang up, and WS fails

Had to try out a bit, but it works for me with this nginx-config:

```
